WEBVTT

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:35.451
Support Admin Watch on
kissasia.cam or kisskh.org

00:01:25.010 --> 00:01:28.090
[Whispers of Fate]

00:01:28.420 --> 00:01:29.940
[Episode 35]

00:01:41.070 --> 00:01:42.120
Mother...

00:01:43.479 --> 00:01:44.789
The Thousand-Armed and Thousand-Eyed

00:01:44.789 --> 00:01:46.990
Unhindered Great Compassion Dharani.

00:02:10.560 --> 00:02:11.240
What they're doing

00:02:11.240 --> 00:02:12.700
won't help with anything.

00:02:13.190 --> 00:02:14.720
There isn't much time left.

00:02:16.220 --> 00:02:17.850
I'll have to use
the Heaven-Halo Technique.

00:02:17.850 --> 00:02:18.980
The Rebirth Scroll?

00:02:19.150 --> 00:02:20.340
Such pure power,

00:02:20.750 --> 00:02:21.750
plus that armor...

00:02:21.750 --> 00:02:22.750
He's the Holy Son!

00:02:24.800 --> 00:02:26.530
Now that you've recognized me,

00:02:26.630 --> 00:02:27.630
why not step back?

00:02:28.410 --> 00:02:29.740
Only I can save her life.

00:02:34.810 --> 00:02:36.140
Heaven Halo, activate!

00:02:43.150 --> 00:02:43.960
It's the Heaven-Halo Technique!

00:02:43.960 --> 00:02:44.490
Retreat!

00:02:44.800 --> 00:02:46.120
Quickly inform the Asura King

00:02:46.120 --> 00:02:47.380
of Lord Ye Mo's return!

00:02:47.560 --> 00:02:49.020
The Goddess will be saved!

00:02:58.630 --> 00:03:00.490
The Heaven-Changing Scripture?

00:03:12.430 --> 00:03:14.030
Didn't expect that, did you?

00:03:14.710 --> 00:03:16.630
As the Holy Son of Tianren Realm,

00:03:16.910 --> 00:03:18.310
you have infinite power.

00:03:18.570 --> 00:03:19.410
Your body

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:21.440
is perfect for me.

00:03:21.460 --> 00:03:23.990
Why give it away to Yique Yinyang
for nothing?

00:03:25.620 --> 00:03:26.800
Since the beginning,

00:03:26.800 --> 00:03:28.240
you've been calculating.

00:03:28.240 --> 00:03:29.950
If I had mistakenly killed the Goddess,

00:03:29.950 --> 00:03:31.410
I wouldn't have been born,

00:03:31.420 --> 00:03:33.590
and Yique Yinyang couldn't be revived.

00:03:33.590 --> 00:03:35.760
Then you could continue being yourself.

00:03:35.760 --> 00:03:36.290
Correct.

00:03:37.150 --> 00:03:38.400
If I didn't kill her,

00:03:38.420 --> 00:03:39.750
you'd use the Heaven-Changing Scripture

00:03:39.750 --> 00:03:41.210
to disrupt her meridians.

00:03:41.470 --> 00:03:42.600
In order to save her,

00:03:43.000 --> 00:03:44.590
I'd definitely activate the Heaven Halo,

00:03:44.590 --> 00:03:46.320
presenting you a chance
to possess my body.

00:03:46.320 --> 00:03:47.230
That's right.

00:03:47.390 --> 00:03:49.680
Knowing that I'd regain my power
in Tianren Realm,

00:03:49.680 --> 00:03:51.450
you had me inhale the toxic air

00:03:51.480 --> 00:03:52.280
given out

00:03:52.280 --> 00:03:53.910
by the plants in the Plum Garden,

00:03:53.910 --> 00:03:55.370
so as to suppress my power.

00:03:55.480 --> 00:03:56.030
Given that,

00:03:56.030 --> 00:03:57.470
even in Tianren Realm,

00:03:57.560 --> 00:03:59.020
the strike I just launched

00:03:59.620 --> 00:04:01.220
wouldn't be able to kill you.

00:04:02.430 --> 00:04:03.630
Tang Lici,

00:04:04.140 --> 00:04:04.630
you

00:04:05.120 --> 00:04:05.750
have

00:04:05.880 --> 00:04:06.280
lost.

00:04:16.829 --> 00:04:17.630
Nonetheless,

00:04:18.190 --> 00:04:19.589
I still need to thank you.

00:04:19.829 --> 00:04:21.230
If it hadn't been for you,

00:04:22.480 --> 00:04:24.430
I would never have known

00:04:25.170 --> 00:04:26.000
that my mother

00:04:27.060 --> 00:04:28.190
has always loved me.

00:04:44.159 --> 00:04:45.390
A Holy Son of Tianren Realm

00:04:45.390 --> 00:04:46.750
with all sorts of emotions...

00:04:46.750 --> 00:04:48.350
What a perfect Tianren body.

00:04:48.780 --> 00:04:50.440
It's finally going to be mine.

00:04:50.750 --> 00:04:51.810
When we become one,

00:04:52.330 --> 00:04:53.190
we'll form

00:04:53.190 --> 00:04:54.560
a new Yique Yinyang.

00:05:00.040 --> 00:05:01.700
Heaven-Changing Scripture,

00:05:02.830 --> 00:05:04.510
reverse the Heaven Halo.

00:05:28.630 --> 00:05:29.920
Under no circumstances

00:05:29.920 --> 00:05:32.120
will Tang Lici turn into Yique Yinyang!

00:05:32.240 --> 00:05:34.040
I'm the son of the Dragon Goddess

00:05:34.420 --> 00:05:35.860
and the real Tianren.

00:05:46.370 --> 00:05:48.159
♪ Vast lands ♪

00:05:48.159 --> 00:05:48.990
Ghostly Peony,

00:05:48.990 --> 00:05:49.480
♪ And boundless skies ♪

00:05:49.480 --> 00:05:52.159
you placed bets on me killing my mother
in a vain attempt

00:05:52.159 --> 00:05:52.920
to make me use the Heaven-Halo Technique,

00:05:52.920 --> 00:05:53.560
♪ The world is in turmoil ♪

00:05:53.560 --> 00:05:54.890
so as to possess my body.

00:05:55.500 --> 00:05:55.800
♪ Storms are rising ♪

00:05:55.800 --> 00:05:57.480
You've truly angered me.

00:05:57.560 --> 00:05:59.090
You've got your power back?

00:05:59.500 --> 00:05:59.580
♪ Heroes stand proud ♪

00:05:59.580 --> 00:06:00.260
Yes.

00:06:00.920 --> 00:06:01.900
Now, I have a complete Tianren body.

00:06:01.900 --> 00:06:03.510
♪ Their will is like steel ♪

00:06:03.510 --> 00:06:04.910
You can't take it from me.

00:06:05.190 --> 00:06:06.430
Don't you yearn to have

00:06:06.430 --> 00:06:06.440
human emotions?

00:06:06.440 --> 00:06:07.870
♪ Through storm and frost,
the swords they wield ♪

00:06:07.900 --> 00:06:08.830
♪ Cutting down all evil
between heaven and earth ♪

00:06:08.830 --> 00:06:09.950
I'll make that

00:06:10.430 --> 00:06:10.990
come true for you.

00:06:10.990 --> 00:06:14.120
♪ Flames of war sweep across the world ♪

00:06:14.420 --> 00:06:17.220
♪ Good has not yet triumphed over evil ♪

00:06:17.610 --> 00:06:18.890
♪ The moon in the water ♪

00:06:18.890 --> 00:06:20.220
Heaven Halo, activate.

00:06:20.740 --> 00:06:23.700
♪ Holds lost dreams ♪

00:06:24.110 --> 00:06:27.070
♪ The world's at the fingertips ♪

00:06:27.340 --> 00:06:30.510
♪ Hidden within a warrior's heart ♪

00:06:30.510 --> 00:06:30.820
Believe in yourself.

00:06:30.820 --> 00:06:31.310
♪ The endless seas and lands ♪

00:06:31.310 --> 00:06:32.360
You won't hurt it.

00:06:33.310 --> 00:06:33.750
♪ Await my burning passion ♪

00:06:33.750 --> 00:06:35.600
Killing is in your nature.

00:06:36.170 --> 00:06:38.030
You have an innate urge for blood.

00:06:38.040 --> 00:06:39.680
I'm not Tang Lici at all!

00:06:40.310 --> 00:06:41.150
Nor do I belong to Zhoudi Tower!

00:06:41.150 --> 00:06:44.159
♪ Facing swords and blades, I roar alone ♪

00:06:44.159 --> 00:06:45.480
Let go!

00:06:47.240 --> 00:06:52.680
♪ With supreme power,
I roam free under heaven ♪

00:06:52.680 --> 00:06:53.470
You monster.

00:06:53.470 --> 00:06:53.950
♪ Mad and laughing
like Buddha or a demon ♪

00:06:53.950 --> 00:06:55.390
But your golden eyes and forehead mark

00:06:55.390 --> 00:06:56.390
look pretty nice.

00:06:57.140 --> 00:06:57.430
♪ A roar, and winds and clouds howl ♪

00:06:57.430 --> 00:06:58.120
Today,

00:06:58.430 --> 00:07:00.480
with me here, you won't get to him!

00:07:00.570 --> 00:07:00.840
♪ Behold the land, miles wide ♪

00:07:00.840 --> 00:07:01.860
There was no other reason.

00:07:01.860 --> 00:07:02.610
I just wanted to save you.

00:07:02.610 --> 00:07:03.750
♪ Where rolling waves surge ♪

00:07:03.750 --> 00:07:05.160
Save your compassion.

00:07:05.680 --> 00:07:06.260
I am a monster.

00:07:06.260 --> 00:07:08.720
♪ Facing swords and blades, I roar alone ♪

00:07:08.720 --> 00:07:10.120
I was created with the purpose

00:07:10.120 --> 00:07:10.830
to kill.

00:07:11.270 --> 00:07:12.670
But you care about Chi Yun

00:07:12.710 --> 00:07:14.650
and everyone else, including me.
♪ With supreme power,
I roam free under heaven ♪

00:07:14.650 --> 00:07:16.400
But Fang Zhou never taught me

00:07:16.430 --> 00:07:17.830
how to love someone.

00:07:19.040 --> 00:07:22.130
♪ Mad and laughing
like Buddha or a demon ♪

00:07:22.550 --> 00:07:25.640
♪ A roar, and winds and clouds howl ♪

00:07:25.820 --> 00:07:28.270
♪ No madness, no fire ♪

00:07:28.420 --> 00:07:32.080
♪ How can one be called a hero? ♪

00:07:43.720 --> 00:07:46.050
Now I know what it is like
to have feelings.

00:08:00.200 --> 00:08:01.330
You finally woke up.

00:08:14.840 --> 00:08:15.960
You look

00:08:16.920 --> 00:08:18.360
exactly

00:08:19.430 --> 00:08:20.550
like I imagined.

00:08:24.930 --> 00:08:25.730
Remember:

00:08:26.810 --> 00:08:27.690
Mother

00:08:28.770 --> 00:08:29.620
loves you.

00:08:48.280 --> 00:08:48.920
Mother.

00:09:40.510 --> 00:09:42.670
The notorious Sky-reaching Pillar

00:09:43.150 --> 00:09:44.940
shouldn't exist at all.

00:09:48.620 --> 00:09:51.020
Dragon fire, burn the non-heavenly titan!

00:10:25.660 --> 00:10:26.660
Yique Yinyang,

00:10:27.670 --> 00:10:29.670
the bronze tree has been destroyed.

00:10:30.060 --> 00:10:32.120
How are you going to come back to life?

00:10:42.840 --> 00:10:44.000
Son,

00:10:44.490 --> 00:10:46.890
take a look at the starry sky
outside for me.

00:10:47.320 --> 00:10:48.150
Remember:

00:10:48.750 --> 00:10:49.470
Mother

00:10:50.680 --> 00:10:51.610
loves you.

00:10:59.050 --> 00:10:59.650
Mother...

00:11:29.670 --> 00:11:30.470
I predicted

00:11:30.490 --> 00:11:32.020
that you'd win this battle.

00:11:33.490 --> 00:11:35.250
But, Mr. Tang, you didn't predict

00:11:35.250 --> 00:11:37.450
that I'd leave without saying goodbye.

00:11:39.200 --> 00:11:41.400
Ghostly Peony attempted to use a puppet

00:11:41.530 --> 00:11:43.260
and the power of the bronze tree

00:11:43.440 --> 00:11:45.480
to guide Yique Yinyang back to life.

00:11:47.350 --> 00:11:48.770
I hid the third pill, the real one,

00:11:48.770 --> 00:11:49.680
from everyone.

00:11:50.350 --> 00:11:52.250
I then merged
the Sky-Fallen Stone fragment in me

00:11:52.250 --> 00:11:53.130
with the pill.

00:11:55.240 --> 00:11:56.090
This time,

00:11:56.820 --> 00:11:57.750
I've finally

00:11:57.750 --> 00:11:59.410
thought one step ahead of you.

00:12:04.670 --> 00:12:06.580
I recalled my real name

00:12:07.390 --> 00:12:08.990
and found out where I'm from.

00:12:11.150 --> 00:12:12.390
I also misunderstood

00:12:12.790 --> 00:12:14.240
and lied to you.

00:12:15.740 --> 00:12:17.340
I can't face you again.

00:12:18.430 --> 00:12:20.090
I just hope that after I leave,

00:12:20.430 --> 00:12:21.480
you'll no longer fear

00:12:21.480 --> 00:12:23.080
being understood by others.

00:12:23.840 --> 00:12:25.530
You hate to explain yourself.

00:12:26.000 --> 00:12:28.200
You don't care if others understand you

00:12:28.320 --> 00:12:29.050
or trust you.

00:12:29.780 --> 00:12:31.130
You don't mind even if everyone

00:12:31.130 --> 00:12:32.330
misunderstands you.

00:12:34.550 --> 00:12:35.610
I used to think of it

00:12:36.030 --> 00:12:37.190
as arrogance.

00:12:38.310 --> 00:12:40.170
Only some time later did I realize

00:12:40.720 --> 00:12:42.180
that you were just afraid.

00:12:42.910 --> 00:12:45.170
You feared
that you didn't deserve to be understood

00:12:45.170 --> 00:12:45.880
or trusted.

00:12:47.470 --> 00:12:49.390
Being understood isn't a bad thing.

00:12:49.390 --> 00:12:50.670
This is the last time

00:12:50.670 --> 00:12:51.870
I offer you my advice.

00:12:54.400 --> 00:12:57.400
At the end of the road,
it's better to let go of the past.

00:12:58.840 --> 00:12:59.440
Mr. Tang,

00:13:00.820 --> 00:13:03.280
let's stay out of each other's life
for good.

00:13:07.390 --> 00:13:08.030
Okay.

00:13:09.360 --> 00:13:10.320
Shei, just go to a place

00:13:10.320 --> 00:13:11.920
where Tang Lici isn't there.

00:13:12.400 --> 00:13:14.270
Lead a life of your choice.

00:13:19.790 --> 00:13:20.450
News of victory!

00:13:20.450 --> 00:13:22.520
Tang Lici, the Guest of Honor
of the Central Plains Sword Alliance,

00:13:22.520 --> 00:13:24.150
ventured alone into enemy lines

00:13:24.150 --> 00:13:25.870
to destroy Fengliu Shop at one fell swoop,

00:13:25.870 --> 00:13:28.530
and eliminated the mastermind,
Ghostly Peony!

00:13:30.200 --> 00:13:31.150
Everyone in Shenji Branch,

00:13:31.150 --> 00:13:31.950
did you see it?

00:13:32.570 --> 00:13:34.320
When the bronze tree collapsed,

00:13:34.320 --> 00:13:36.630
the earth split, mountains crumbled,
and flames went everywhere!

00:13:36.630 --> 00:13:37.910
First, Xiuyu Peony Pavilion fell.

00:13:37.910 --> 00:13:39.320
Then, the Plum Garden was flattened.

00:13:39.320 --> 00:13:40.750
The enemy's base and final stronghold

00:13:40.750 --> 00:13:42.320
were taken down by us once at a time.

00:13:42.320 --> 00:13:43.050
Fengliu Shop

00:13:43.350 --> 00:13:45.360
will never stand a chance to rise again!

00:13:45.360 --> 00:13:46.720
Bravo!

00:13:46.910 --> 00:13:48.960
Victory is finally ours
after such a long time!

00:13:48.960 --> 00:13:49.890
How satisfying!

00:13:50.750 --> 00:13:52.280
It's good to take an optimistic attitude.

00:13:52.280 --> 00:13:52.940
However...

00:13:53.630 --> 00:13:54.380
has Shenji Branch

00:13:54.380 --> 00:13:55.910
found any trails of Mr. Tang

00:13:56.440 --> 00:13:56.980
and Mr. Chi,

00:13:56.980 --> 00:13:58.710
who went to look for the former?

00:13:59.300 --> 00:13:59.910
Well...

00:14:00.240 --> 00:14:01.200
Given the complex terrain

00:14:01.200 --> 00:14:02.240
of Puti Valley,

00:14:02.420 --> 00:14:03.330
and that we are remotely

00:14:03.330 --> 00:14:04.530
stationed this time,

00:14:04.540 --> 00:14:06.520
we can only figure out
their general movements.

00:14:06.520 --> 00:14:07.810
With luck, they'll be able

00:14:07.810 --> 00:14:09.590
to escape before the mountain collapses.

00:14:09.590 --> 00:14:10.920
But without luck...

00:14:11.120 --> 00:14:13.320
Stop picturing the worst case scenario.

00:14:13.320 --> 00:14:14.000
I just...

00:14:14.510 --> 00:14:15.630
People are finally having a chance

00:14:15.630 --> 00:14:16.890
to take a breather now.

00:14:17.320 --> 00:14:18.120
In my opinion,

00:14:18.630 --> 00:14:20.270
we should delay announcing

00:14:21.430 --> 00:14:22.960
Mr. Tang's disappearance.

00:14:25.900 --> 00:14:27.670
[Half a month later]

00:14:27.670 --> 00:14:28.360
One.

00:14:29.410 --> 00:14:29.840
Two.

00:14:31.810 --> 00:14:33.170
Everyone, look sharp!

00:14:33.530 --> 00:14:34.920
Just because we've won doesn't mean

00:14:34.920 --> 00:14:35.820
we can slack off.

00:14:35.820 --> 00:14:36.530
Some members

00:14:36.530 --> 00:14:38.120
of Fengliu Shop are still at large.

00:14:38.120 --> 00:14:39.080
It depends on you to maintain

00:14:39.080 --> 00:14:41.480
the order
of the future martial arts world.

00:14:43.200 --> 00:14:44.080
Your Highness.

00:14:45.610 --> 00:14:46.330
Dismissed.

00:14:51.960 --> 00:14:53.020
I, Gu Xitan, am glad

00:14:53.910 --> 00:14:55.170
to meet Your Highness.

00:14:55.600 --> 00:14:56.660
Where is my master?

00:14:57.920 --> 00:14:58.610
Where is he?

00:14:59.160 --> 00:15:01.020
Master Shao is in Qingyang Realm.

00:15:09.600 --> 00:15:10.460
Your Highness!

00:15:14.000 --> 00:15:14.390
May I ask

00:15:14.390 --> 00:15:15.640
if you were conscious

00:15:16.870 --> 00:15:18.330
when you stabbed Mr. Tang?

00:15:22.030 --> 00:15:23.160
Will you believe me?

00:15:24.200 --> 00:15:25.330
I'd love to, if I can,

00:15:25.850 --> 00:15:26.490
Ms. Zhong.

00:15:46.840 --> 00:15:48.550
Master, after you entrusted

00:15:48.550 --> 00:15:50.270
the Sword Alliance to my care,

00:15:50.900 --> 00:15:52.240
I spent 10 years fixing

00:15:52.740 --> 00:15:54.740
the damage caused by Yique Yinyang,

00:15:55.320 --> 00:15:57.120
and 10 years elevating my spirit

00:15:57.230 --> 00:15:58.480
as I longed for jianghu

00:15:58.480 --> 00:16:00.480
to be reshaped by drastic measures.

00:16:00.770 --> 00:16:01.970
I have waited 10 years

00:16:02.600 --> 00:16:03.910
for the game changer.

00:16:04.390 --> 00:16:04.850
Master,

00:16:05.600 --> 00:16:06.860
why are you here alone?

00:16:08.150 --> 00:16:08.840
I...

00:16:10.030 --> 00:16:12.440
I'm admiring the scenery of Mount Cloud.

00:16:14.390 --> 00:16:16.630
I used to be so busy with the affairs
of the Sword Alliance

00:16:16.630 --> 00:16:17.510
that I never knew

00:16:17.510 --> 00:16:19.710
there was such beautiful scenery here.

00:16:19.720 --> 00:16:21.440
People can't see

00:16:22.440 --> 00:16:23.550
what they normally can't

00:16:23.550 --> 00:16:26.150
until they take a pause
from hustle and bustle.

00:16:31.440 --> 00:16:32.600
I heard...

00:16:33.150 --> 00:16:34.480
that Chi Yun and Shen

00:16:34.480 --> 00:16:35.880
went to look for Mr. Tang.

00:16:39.240 --> 00:16:40.770
I'm talking about Mr. Tang.

00:16:44.080 --> 00:16:44.750
Master!

00:16:45.390 --> 00:16:45.960
Master!

00:16:47.030 --> 00:16:47.550
Master!

00:16:59.600 --> 00:17:00.240
Senior,

00:17:00.720 --> 00:17:02.250
what happened to my master?

00:17:02.430 --> 00:17:03.510
He worked himself into illness,

00:17:03.510 --> 00:17:05.480
which has already taken a toll
on his health.

00:17:05.480 --> 00:17:06.790
Then, during the battle on Mount Cloud,

00:17:06.790 --> 00:17:08.030
he suffered severe internal injuries.

00:17:08.030 --> 00:17:09.490
Instead of working again,

00:17:09.550 --> 00:17:11.010
he should've taken a rest.

00:17:11.030 --> 00:17:11.790
Now, his heart

00:17:11.790 --> 00:17:13.000
and meridians have been harmed.

00:17:13.000 --> 00:17:14.069
At this rate,

00:17:14.069 --> 00:17:15.619
you'll even die before Tang Lici does.

00:17:15.619 --> 00:17:17.079
Is it really that serious?

00:17:17.329 --> 00:17:19.230
It seems I've discovered more than

00:17:19.230 --> 00:17:22.150
the scenery of Mount Cloud
during this pause from work.

00:17:22.150 --> 00:17:23.020
Master,

00:17:23.819 --> 00:17:25.339
please listen to Senior.

00:17:34.270 --> 00:17:35.000
Master Shao.

00:17:36.720 --> 00:17:37.610
Look at you.

00:17:38.000 --> 00:17:39.530
You haven't recovered yet.

00:17:39.680 --> 00:17:40.960
Why come here

00:17:40.960 --> 00:17:42.160
to join the crowd?

00:17:43.290 --> 00:17:45.380
At least I can still stand on my feet.

00:17:46.270 --> 00:17:47.640
All I suffered

00:17:48.180 --> 00:17:49.700
was a tiny little injury.

00:17:50.310 --> 00:17:51.510
This "tiny little injury"

00:17:51.510 --> 00:17:52.590
nearly killed you.

00:17:53.110 --> 00:17:54.260
It hasn't healed after half a month.

00:17:54.260 --> 00:17:55.680
Fengliu Shop has been taken down already.

00:17:55.680 --> 00:17:56.400
God knows what you are

00:17:56.400 --> 00:17:57.510
still busy with every day.

00:17:57.510 --> 00:17:59.310
There's something I have to say.

00:17:59.640 --> 00:18:00.500
Senior Shui...

00:18:01.880 --> 00:18:02.790
Miss Shui,

00:18:04.160 --> 00:18:04.790
Chunji,

00:18:05.300 --> 00:18:07.630
I'd like to have a word with Master Cheng

00:18:08.010 --> 00:18:09.620
and Master Puzhu in private.

00:18:17.310 --> 00:18:18.640
Master Shao is inviting all the elders

00:18:18.640 --> 00:18:20.030
and Branch Chiefs of the Sword Alliance

00:18:20.030 --> 00:18:21.030
to Qingyang Realm for a discussion

00:18:21.030 --> 00:18:22.290
on an important issue.

00:18:24.180 --> 00:18:27.110
Today, I gathered all of you here

00:18:27.370 --> 00:18:29.370
to make an announcement.

00:18:29.830 --> 00:18:30.790
What happened?

00:18:33.040 --> 00:18:34.170
I've decided

00:18:34.310 --> 00:18:36.000
to step down as Sword Master

00:18:36.390 --> 00:18:38.520
of the Central Plains Sword Alliance.

00:18:40.320 --> 00:18:42.450
Though Fengliu Shop has been crushed,

00:18:42.700 --> 00:18:45.210
its members at large
might cause turbulence again.

00:18:45.210 --> 00:18:46.850
Tough measures must be taken promptly

00:18:46.850 --> 00:18:48.180
to root out all the evil.

00:18:48.880 --> 00:18:51.050
My frail body can no longer
bear heavy responsibilities.

00:18:51.050 --> 00:18:52.050
It is high time

00:18:52.080 --> 00:18:53.690
you elected a new leader.

00:18:53.960 --> 00:18:54.690
Master Shao,

00:18:55.000 --> 00:18:55.750
the Sword Alliance

00:18:55.750 --> 00:18:57.280
still needs your leadership.

00:18:57.280 --> 00:18:58.410
Please reconsider.

00:18:58.750 --> 00:19:00.350
Master Shao, please reconsider.

00:19:00.350 --> 00:19:01.440
Please reconsider!

00:19:01.440 --> 00:19:02.770
Don't worry, everyone.

00:19:03.070 --> 00:19:04.640
I've consulted Master Puzhu

00:19:04.640 --> 00:19:05.640
and Master Cheng.

00:19:06.160 --> 00:19:08.480
In the next two months,
Master Cheng will be

00:19:08.480 --> 00:19:10.070
the acting Sword Master.

00:19:10.640 --> 00:19:12.780
There's still time
before the election begins,

00:19:12.780 --> 00:19:14.510
which allows us to deliberate.

00:19:14.680 --> 00:19:15.830
Master Shao, do you

00:19:16.240 --> 00:19:18.370
have anyone in mind as your successor?

00:19:18.810 --> 00:19:20.350
None of the former Sword Masters

00:19:20.350 --> 00:19:22.550
were appointed by their predecessors.

00:19:23.000 --> 00:19:23.680
They were nominated

00:19:23.680 --> 00:19:25.810
by senior members such as yourselves.

00:19:26.000 --> 00:19:26.730
Master Shao,

00:19:27.790 --> 00:19:30.200
does everyone get to make a nomination?

00:19:30.640 --> 00:19:31.310
Of course.

00:19:31.750 --> 00:19:32.680
Anyone can

00:19:32.680 --> 00:19:34.240
be nominated.

00:19:34.550 --> 00:19:36.440
The key is
to gain the approval and recognition

00:19:36.440 --> 00:19:37.790
of the alliance and everyone.

00:19:37.790 --> 00:19:38.480
That said,

00:19:38.590 --> 00:19:40.830
a proven record of upholding justice
in the martial world

00:19:40.830 --> 00:19:42.760
would be a significant advantage.

00:19:44.310 --> 00:19:45.040
Master Shao,

00:19:45.830 --> 00:19:47.160
I'd like to nominate...

00:19:47.630 --> 00:19:48.150
myself.

00:19:52.110 --> 00:19:52.590
What?

00:19:55.680 --> 00:19:56.480
Miss Xifang,

00:19:56.480 --> 00:19:58.070
you've just joined the Sword Alliance...

00:19:58.070 --> 00:19:59.680
Indeed, I'm new here
and still familiarizing myself

00:19:59.680 --> 00:20:01.080
with the Sword Alliance.

00:20:01.360 --> 00:20:02.620
May I ask, Master Shao,

00:20:03.070 --> 00:20:04.550
if seniority is a must for those running

00:20:04.550 --> 00:20:06.410
for the position of Sword Master?

00:20:06.820 --> 00:20:07.900
As far as I know,

00:20:08.510 --> 00:20:10.120
Mr. Tang didn't join the Sword Alliance

00:20:10.120 --> 00:20:11.690
much earlier than I did.

00:20:12.310 --> 00:20:13.030
Is Mr. Tang,

00:20:13.030 --> 00:20:15.400
who has rendered monumental service
to the alliance,

00:20:15.400 --> 00:20:16.440
also not qualified

00:20:16.440 --> 00:20:18.640
to run for the position of Sword Master?

00:20:19.120 --> 00:20:20.440
Since you know little

00:20:20.440 --> 00:20:21.750
about the Sword Alliance,

00:20:21.750 --> 00:20:24.210
why boldly engage yourself
in the election?

00:20:24.310 --> 00:20:25.510
I don't know much now,

00:20:25.680 --> 00:20:27.830
but it doesn't mean
I'd stay that way forever.

00:20:27.830 --> 00:20:28.720
Besides, I'm also

00:20:28.720 --> 00:20:30.650
a member of the Sword Alliance now.

00:20:31.240 --> 00:20:33.350
Seniority is not a must for those

00:20:33.830 --> 00:20:35.840
running for the position of Sword Master.

00:20:35.840 --> 00:20:37.770
But the approval of all the masters

00:20:38.290 --> 00:20:41.050
and disciples is still necessary.

00:20:43.400 --> 00:20:44.730
Thank you, Master Shao.

00:20:45.550 --> 00:20:46.590
All I need to know

00:20:46.950 --> 00:20:47.970
is that I'm qualified

00:20:47.970 --> 00:20:50.170
to run for the position of Sword Master.

00:20:50.590 --> 00:20:52.650
As for gaining people's approval...

00:20:53.200 --> 00:20:54.720
that's my own concern.

00:20:59.680 --> 00:21:00.920
Miss Xifang,

00:21:00.920 --> 00:21:02.510
since you joined the Sword Alliance,

00:21:02.510 --> 00:21:04.640
you've appeared eager and ambitious.

00:21:05.440 --> 00:21:06.790
You and I are merely

00:21:07.550 --> 00:21:08.920
acquaintances.

00:21:10.240 --> 00:21:11.240
Master Puzhu,

00:21:11.830 --> 00:21:13.000
as her referee,

00:21:14.920 --> 00:21:16.120
what's your opinion?

00:21:18.550 --> 00:21:19.550
It's unnecessary

00:21:19.750 --> 00:21:22.280
to trouble Master Puzhu
with my own business.

00:21:22.350 --> 00:21:23.070
Master Puzhu

00:21:23.070 --> 00:21:24.680
is simply a guide for me.

00:21:26.070 --> 00:21:28.270
The path I'll walk in the Sword Alliance

00:21:28.790 --> 00:21:29.960
doesn't necessarily

00:21:29.960 --> 00:21:31.890
have to be decided by Master Puzhu.

00:21:34.790 --> 00:21:35.640
I know

00:21:36.000 --> 00:21:37.240
that you, Master Shao,

00:21:37.240 --> 00:21:38.900
and Master Cheng have doubts.

00:21:39.310 --> 00:21:40.830
Since I used to work for Fengliu Shop,

00:21:40.830 --> 00:21:42.830
your concerns are understandable.

00:21:43.230 --> 00:21:45.030
Let me just point out two things.

00:21:45.480 --> 00:21:46.070
First,

00:21:46.550 --> 00:21:48.150
among all the people present

00:21:48.270 --> 00:21:49.400
except Master Cheng

00:21:49.590 --> 00:21:50.830
and Master Puzhu,

00:21:51.540 --> 00:21:53.470
I am the best martial fighter here.

00:21:53.880 --> 00:21:54.440
Second,

00:21:55.030 --> 00:21:56.350
though Fengliu Shop has been defeated,

00:21:56.350 --> 00:21:58.680
its remaining power
could still be a threat.

00:21:58.680 --> 00:21:59.750
Nobody knows

00:21:59.750 --> 00:22:01.160
Fengliu Shop better than I do.

00:22:01.160 --> 00:22:01.820
Therefore,

00:22:02.330 --> 00:22:04.390
before Fengliu Shop is annihilated,

00:22:04.790 --> 00:22:06.590
I'm most suited for the position

00:22:07.030 --> 00:22:08.760
of Sword Master, temporarily.

00:22:09.160 --> 00:22:09.960
Temporarily?

00:22:10.160 --> 00:22:11.090
What do you mean?

00:22:13.680 --> 00:22:15.340
I hereby swear to all of you...

00:22:18.720 --> 00:22:19.780
Within half a year,

00:22:20.270 --> 00:22:21.800
I'll root out Fengliu Shop.

00:22:22.850 --> 00:22:23.760
Well...

00:22:28.790 --> 00:22:29.590
After that,

00:22:29.870 --> 00:22:31.270
I'm willing to step down,

00:22:31.480 --> 00:22:32.680
so the Sword Alliance

00:22:32.760 --> 00:22:34.360
can elect a new Sword Master.

00:22:35.270 --> 00:22:35.920
Why?

00:22:36.720 --> 00:22:38.030
Miss Xifang, are you planning

00:22:38.030 --> 00:22:39.030
to fulfill

00:22:39.480 --> 00:22:41.210
some sort of wish in half a year?

00:22:42.310 --> 00:22:44.710
I'm aware of the grave sins
I've committed.

00:22:44.720 --> 00:22:46.980
Running for the position of Sword Master

00:22:47.000 --> 00:22:48.310
is never my intention,

00:22:49.030 --> 00:22:50.490
but I have no other choice.

00:22:51.160 --> 00:22:52.620
If I am to atone for my sins,

00:22:52.700 --> 00:22:54.130
my only option is to eradicate

00:22:54.130 --> 00:22:55.000
Fengliu Shop.

00:22:57.590 --> 00:22:58.480
In that case,

00:22:59.160 --> 00:23:00.070
Miss Xifang,

00:23:00.550 --> 00:23:02.150
why apply to be Sword Master?

00:23:02.440 --> 00:23:03.770
Just lead from the front

00:23:03.810 --> 00:23:06.610
when we attack Fengliu Shop.
Won't that be enough?

00:23:11.700 --> 00:23:12.300
Everyone,

00:23:13.920 --> 00:23:15.350
I also think I'm qualified

00:23:15.350 --> 00:23:17.550
to run for the position of Sword Master.

00:23:18.230 --> 00:23:18.880
Well...

00:23:26.190 --> 00:23:27.050
Your Highness,

00:23:27.920 --> 00:23:29.450
leading the Sword Alliance

00:23:29.510 --> 00:23:30.970
is by no means an easy task.

00:23:31.940 --> 00:23:32.550
Of course,

00:23:32.830 --> 00:23:33.790
I'm not looking down

00:23:33.790 --> 00:23:35.720
on Your Highness's capabilities.

00:23:36.100 --> 00:23:37.480
But even Master Puzhu

00:23:37.480 --> 00:23:38.410
and Master Cheng

00:23:38.640 --> 00:23:40.310
show no interest in this position.

00:23:40.310 --> 00:23:41.110
So, you see...

00:23:42.510 --> 00:23:43.200
Ms. Zhong,

00:23:43.310 --> 00:23:44.910
I suggest you just be content

00:23:45.910 --> 00:23:48.110
with your position as a royal princess.

00:23:48.310 --> 00:23:49.200
But, I...

00:23:51.670 --> 00:23:53.710
am my Master's only disciple

00:23:54.440 --> 00:23:56.300
and the chief of Shanfeng Branch.

00:23:56.510 --> 00:23:57.480
Since the age of eight,

00:23:57.480 --> 00:23:59.200
I've been observing how Master

00:23:59.200 --> 00:24:01.930
manages the Sword Alliance
by his side every day.

00:24:02.000 --> 00:24:03.750
I've handled more alliance affairs

00:24:03.750 --> 00:24:04.880
than the fellow martial practitioners

00:24:04.880 --> 00:24:06.880
you killed
when you worked for Fengliu Shop.

00:24:06.880 --> 00:24:07.830
Miss Xifang,

00:24:07.830 --> 00:24:09.830
as a newcomer
who was an outsider not long ago,

00:24:09.830 --> 00:24:12.090
you have the nerve to enter the election.

00:24:12.110 --> 00:24:14.240
How am I, the chief of Shanfeng Branch,

00:24:14.440 --> 00:24:15.570
the least qualified

00:24:15.910 --> 00:24:17.240
candidate for the post?

00:24:19.070 --> 00:24:20.070
It seems Your Highness has quickly

00:24:20.070 --> 00:24:21.730
got tired of being a princess.

00:24:30.220 --> 00:24:30.950
Master Shao.

00:24:37.910 --> 00:24:38.980
Mr. Tang is back!

00:24:41.740 --> 00:24:42.590
Mr. Tang?

00:24:43.420 --> 00:24:44.240
Mr. Tang?

00:24:48.550 --> 00:24:49.200
I wonder

00:24:50.310 --> 00:24:52.240
if I'm qualified for the election.

00:24:57.030 --> 00:24:58.070
Mr. Tang,

00:24:58.960 --> 00:25:00.220
you finally came back.

00:25:00.830 --> 00:25:02.000
Your injuries...

00:25:02.110 --> 00:25:02.680
I'm fine.

00:25:03.590 --> 00:25:04.920
I have fully recovered.

00:25:05.310 --> 00:25:05.970
However...

00:25:07.550 --> 00:25:08.920
You don't seem well,

00:25:09.360 --> 00:25:10.600
Master Shao.

00:25:17.640 --> 00:25:18.770
I venture to compete

00:25:19.150 --> 00:25:21.880
for the position
of the Sword Alliance's Sword Master.

00:25:21.880 --> 00:25:22.830
I hope to have

00:25:23.590 --> 00:25:24.640
your support.

00:26:03.550 --> 00:26:04.980
When I saw Mr. Tang,

00:26:05.270 --> 00:26:07.070
my body was out of control,

00:26:09.910 --> 00:26:10.910
and I stabbed him.

00:26:18.300 --> 00:26:19.160
Your Highness,

00:26:19.750 --> 00:26:21.810
will you withdraw from the election?

00:26:23.830 --> 00:26:24.750
At the moment,

00:26:26.730 --> 00:26:27.960
Master needs a good rest.

00:26:27.960 --> 00:26:30.360
I'm afraid the successor he deems suitable

00:26:30.580 --> 00:26:31.420
may not be me.

00:26:35.200 --> 00:26:36.260
It's also my belief

00:26:36.340 --> 00:26:38.550
that after making so many contributions,

00:26:38.550 --> 00:26:39.830
it's time for Master Shao to recuperate,

00:26:39.830 --> 00:26:41.430
since the battle is over now.

00:26:42.310 --> 00:26:43.160
But Your Highness is indeed

00:26:43.160 --> 00:26:44.890
more familiar with the alliance affairs
than others.

00:26:44.890 --> 00:26:46.290
Mr. Tang's sudden return

00:26:46.510 --> 00:26:47.590
may not be good news

00:26:48.490 --> 00:26:49.640
to Your Highness.

00:26:51.720 --> 00:26:52.910
Your Highness comes from jianghu

00:26:52.910 --> 00:26:54.040
and values loyalty.

00:26:54.510 --> 00:26:55.440
It's admirable.

00:26:56.230 --> 00:26:57.360
But the old days have passed.

00:26:57.360 --> 00:26:59.640
Now,
Your Highness is the Emperor's daughter.

00:26:59.640 --> 00:27:00.400
That means

00:27:00.400 --> 00:27:02.440
Your Highness can't act like
someone in jianghu anymore,

00:27:02.440 --> 00:27:04.480
especially not
be too emotionally involved.

00:27:04.480 --> 00:27:05.410
That won't bring

00:27:05.590 --> 00:27:06.390
anything good

00:27:06.690 --> 00:27:08.350
to Your Highness or the court.

00:27:09.440 --> 00:27:10.510
Are you suggesting

00:27:10.910 --> 00:27:12.510
I go against my Master's will

00:27:13.200 --> 00:27:14.680
and replace him?

00:27:16.350 --> 00:27:16.980
I dare not.

00:27:18.140 --> 00:27:19.740
Without Master's guidance,

00:27:19.960 --> 00:27:22.020
I wouldn't have become who I am today.

00:27:22.510 --> 00:27:24.030
I don't allow anyone to be disrespectful

00:27:24.030 --> 00:27:25.070
to my Master.

00:27:25.960 --> 00:27:26.920
I've overstepped my bounds.

00:27:26.920 --> 00:27:28.730
I beg for Your Highness's forgiveness.

00:27:28.730 --> 00:27:30.470
But has Your Highness thought about this?

00:27:30.470 --> 00:27:32.130
Now, Fengliu Shop has fallen.

00:27:32.510 --> 00:27:33.510
The future martial arts world

00:27:33.510 --> 00:27:34.550
needs a Sword Master

00:27:34.550 --> 00:27:36.880
who's adept in governance
and the art of balance.

00:27:36.880 --> 00:27:38.590
Your Highness is a member of the court

00:27:38.590 --> 00:27:40.590
and Master Shao's direct disciple.

00:27:41.640 --> 00:27:42.790
Your Highness has great respect

00:27:42.790 --> 00:27:43.720
and care for Master Zhao,

00:27:43.720 --> 00:27:45.520
and thus won't be a threat to him.

00:27:46.550 --> 00:27:48.560
But will others in the Sword Alliance

00:27:48.560 --> 00:27:50.480
still be bound to Master Shao
by the ties of discipleship

00:27:50.480 --> 00:27:51.880
just like Your Highness?

00:27:52.110 --> 00:27:53.440
You're referring to...

00:27:54.580 --> 00:27:55.560
Xifang Tao?

00:27:56.070 --> 00:27:57.680
Xifang Tao acts flamboyantly

00:27:57.680 --> 00:27:59.410
and curries favor everywhere.

00:27:59.640 --> 00:28:00.920
Mr. Tang always takes radical action,

00:28:00.920 --> 00:28:03.070
and on top of that,
he has been wounded by Your Highness.

00:28:03.070 --> 00:28:05.000
At the moment, Master Shao is unwell.

00:28:05.000 --> 00:28:06.190
I'm afraid the rivalry

00:28:06.190 --> 00:28:06.750
between Mr. Tang and Xifang Tao

00:28:06.750 --> 00:28:08.400
will plunge the alliance
into a new crisis,

00:28:08.400 --> 00:28:10.310
and that Your Highness
will lose your foothold.

00:28:10.310 --> 00:28:12.350
Neither Master Shao nor the Emperor

00:28:12.640 --> 00:28:14.300
would like to see that happen.

00:28:14.720 --> 00:28:15.580
Your Highness,

00:28:15.640 --> 00:28:18.570
that suggestion of mine
is not only for your own good,

00:28:18.690 --> 00:28:20.640
but also for the interest
of the entire jianghu

00:28:20.640 --> 00:28:22.370
and your master's life's work.

00:28:32.480 --> 00:28:33.310
I get it.

00:28:35.110 --> 00:28:35.910
You may leave.

00:28:47.640 --> 00:28:48.240
Senior!

00:28:51.240 --> 00:28:52.240
I see you're back.

00:28:53.030 --> 00:28:54.410
Now that Fengliu Shop has collapsed,

00:28:54.410 --> 00:28:56.030
you won't have to tire yourself out
anymore.

00:28:56.030 --> 00:28:56.680
From now on,

00:28:56.680 --> 00:28:57.880
come here more often.

00:28:58.160 --> 00:28:59.690
I'll make sure you get well.

00:29:00.350 --> 00:29:01.310
Take a seat over there.

00:29:01.310 --> 00:29:02.440
I'll check your pulse later

00:29:02.440 --> 00:29:03.700
to see how you've been.

00:29:04.830 --> 00:29:05.550
I'm not ill.

00:29:07.720 --> 00:29:09.580
Only the doctor has the final say.

00:29:20.510 --> 00:29:22.440
You already got your martial strength
back.

00:29:22.440 --> 00:29:23.770
But since your power and blood
have been depleted,

00:29:23.770 --> 00:29:25.070
and your inner energy disrupted,

00:29:25.070 --> 00:29:26.310
you won't be able to heal

00:29:26.310 --> 00:29:27.910
as fast and easily as before.

00:29:28.310 --> 00:29:30.400
These days,
you must refrain from losing blood

00:29:30.400 --> 00:29:31.480
and using the Rebirth Scroll again

00:29:31.480 --> 00:29:32.280
to save lives.

00:29:33.550 --> 00:29:35.080
Those three pills have been used up.

00:29:35.080 --> 00:29:36.160
Your current condition is far more

00:29:36.160 --> 00:29:37.030
dangerous than you imagine.

00:29:37.030 --> 00:29:39.200
One reckless move could cost your life.

00:29:39.200 --> 00:29:39.790
Senior,

00:29:40.830 --> 00:29:41.880
if anyone asks,

00:29:42.360 --> 00:29:44.760
can you reply
with the first sentence only?

00:29:46.790 --> 00:29:47.400
Senior.

00:29:48.200 --> 00:29:49.310
Now, the Sword Alliance

00:29:49.310 --> 00:29:49.960
needs

00:29:49.960 --> 00:29:51.440
a Tang Lici in his prime.

00:29:52.440 --> 00:29:53.440
And my companions

00:29:53.880 --> 00:29:54.960
also need that.

00:29:55.580 --> 00:29:56.340
So,

00:29:57.080 --> 00:29:58.210
please do me a favor.

00:30:02.240 --> 00:30:03.200
Does Shei still count

00:30:03.200 --> 00:30:04.530
as a companion of yours?

00:30:10.070 --> 00:30:10.680
Master.

00:30:12.000 --> 00:30:12.930
Are you alright?

00:30:13.510 --> 00:30:14.790
Hearing about your return,

00:30:14.790 --> 00:30:16.030
he insisted on visiting you.

00:30:16.030 --> 00:30:17.490
I couldn't stop him at all.

00:30:20.400 --> 00:30:21.130
Don't worry.

00:30:22.070 --> 00:30:22.920
I'm fine.

00:30:24.920 --> 00:30:25.980
How's your health?

00:30:31.190 --> 00:30:33.320
He has regained his martial strength.

00:30:33.590 --> 00:30:34.450
Anything else?

00:30:35.110 --> 00:30:36.550
He's fine. Just leave.

00:30:36.860 --> 00:30:38.990
All this noise is giving me a headache.

00:30:39.920 --> 00:30:40.980
Thank you, Senior.

00:30:42.880 --> 00:30:43.410
Let's go.

00:31:03.310 --> 00:31:04.200
Shei...

00:31:04.880 --> 00:31:05.440
is gone.

00:31:10.030 --> 00:31:10.920
Miss Shei

00:31:11.680 --> 00:31:12.480
already left.

00:31:13.070 --> 00:31:14.070
When will she...

00:31:15.030 --> 00:31:15.630
come back?

00:31:19.160 --> 00:31:20.620
She won't be back anymore.

00:31:20.720 --> 00:31:21.980
Master, you're lying.

00:31:22.030 --> 00:31:23.830
Shei likes you a lot.

00:31:24.640 --> 00:31:26.300
She'll definitely come back.

00:31:45.350 --> 00:31:47.350
Anything you want to say to me, Shen?

00:31:48.920 --> 00:31:50.450
Chi Yun went to look for you.

00:31:50.820 --> 00:31:52.190
I asked him to send me messages,

00:31:52.190 --> 00:31:53.890
but I haven't heard from him so far.

00:31:53.890 --> 00:31:55.230
How long has he been gone?

00:31:55.230 --> 00:31:56.490
More than half a month.

00:32:00.200 --> 00:32:01.530
There's one more thing.

00:32:02.550 --> 00:32:04.310
I received a message from Chief,

00:32:04.310 --> 00:32:04.960
saying that he had

00:32:04.960 --> 00:32:05.920
found the last jewel

00:32:05.920 --> 00:32:07.460
of the Seven-Treasure Jade Hairpin,

00:32:07.460 --> 00:32:09.920
and that I should go back
to Shisan Tower instantly.

00:32:09.920 --> 00:32:11.720
If I arrive before the deadline,

00:32:11.830 --> 00:32:13.830
he'll return Huiniang's body to me.

00:32:13.920 --> 00:32:14.640
If not,

00:32:15.120 --> 00:32:17.190
he'll consider it a breach of agreement

00:32:17.190 --> 00:32:18.850
and destroy Huiniang's body.

00:32:19.720 --> 00:32:21.520
When's the deadline he gave you?

00:32:22.110 --> 00:32:23.030
Tomorrow noon.

00:32:28.240 --> 00:32:29.750
This matter can't wait.

00:32:30.680 --> 00:32:31.160
Shen,

00:32:32.310 --> 00:32:33.440
set off today.

00:32:34.750 --> 00:32:36.010
But what about Chi Yun?

00:32:40.790 --> 00:32:41.520
I'm here now.

00:32:42.000 --> 00:32:43.460
How are you still worried?

00:32:44.030 --> 00:32:44.550
I'm not.

00:32:45.960 --> 00:32:46.490
Goodbye.

00:32:47.480 --> 00:32:48.610
No need to see me off.

00:32:51.070 --> 00:32:51.680
Bye.

00:33:01.790 --> 00:33:02.480
Master,

00:33:03.110 --> 00:33:04.040
why are there...

00:33:04.480 --> 00:33:06.080
less and less people around?

00:33:08.920 --> 00:33:09.520
People...

00:33:10.200 --> 00:33:11.400
are born to be

00:33:11.950 --> 00:33:13.430
separate individuals.

00:33:14.270 --> 00:33:14.640
No.

00:33:15.570 --> 00:33:17.370
I'll always be with you, Master.

00:33:23.880 --> 00:33:24.440
Sure.

00:33:33.030 --> 00:33:34.890
I asked to meet you for an inquiry.

00:33:35.240 --> 00:33:36.050
Do you know

00:33:36.190 --> 00:33:37.950
where the Plum Garden is?

00:33:38.280 --> 00:33:38.960
[Half a month ago]

00:33:38.960 --> 00:33:40.220
It has been destroyed.

00:33:40.300 --> 00:33:41.500
Tang Lici is fine now.

00:33:42.070 --> 00:33:43.000
You can go now.

00:33:44.720 --> 00:33:45.380
Miss Bai...

00:33:48.400 --> 00:33:49.030
I don't know

00:33:49.030 --> 00:33:50.640
what secrets you're keeping from me.

00:33:50.640 --> 00:33:52.510
But I know you're a good person.

00:33:55.640 --> 00:33:56.230
Chi Yun,

00:33:56.830 --> 00:33:57.960
stop waiting for me.

00:34:03.440 --> 00:34:04.510
Miss Bai...

00:34:06.880 --> 00:34:07.590
I'm sorry.

00:34:08.840 --> 00:34:12.170
I shouldn't have bothered you
with my unrequited feelings.

00:34:16.040 --> 00:34:17.870
[Marriage Agreement]

00:34:17.870 --> 00:34:20.070
Your father arranged a marriage for us.

00:34:20.440 --> 00:34:22.840
I've been carrying this agreement with me.

00:34:23.250 --> 00:34:25.449
I've finally realized how foolish I was

00:34:25.550 --> 00:34:26.750
for thinking I could marry you

00:34:26.750 --> 00:34:28.610
based on this mere sheet of paper.

00:34:35.480 --> 00:34:37.739
I've burned the marriage agreement now.

00:34:38.320 --> 00:34:39.580
It's officially void.

00:34:39.760 --> 00:34:40.440
I, Chi Yun,

00:34:41.750 --> 00:34:43.070
swear to make you gladly marry me

00:34:43.070 --> 00:34:43.530
one day.

00:34:44.230 --> 00:34:45.360
If I can't marry you,

00:34:45.590 --> 00:34:47.050
I won't marry anyone else.

00:34:55.840 --> 00:34:56.670
Whatever.

00:34:57.760 --> 00:34:59.090
It's your own business.

00:35:00.480 --> 00:35:01.190
Besides,

00:35:02.730 --> 00:35:04.590
I have my own matters to attend to.

00:35:30.650 --> 00:35:31.780
She came here alone.

00:35:32.590 --> 00:35:33.920
Did Fengliu Shop force her

00:35:33.920 --> 00:35:34.850
to do something?

00:35:35.740 --> 00:35:37.940
That's bad. I must follow her.

00:35:41.960 --> 00:35:45.120
[Tingyun Pavilion]

00:35:47.550 --> 00:35:48.070
Come on.

00:35:48.670 --> 00:35:50.930
Try the newly harvested tea of this year.

00:35:55.190 --> 00:35:56.230
Rich aroma.

00:35:56.480 --> 00:35:57.540
Sweet aftertaste.

00:35:58.590 --> 00:36:00.920
It's a fine product from Camellia Island.

00:36:01.440 --> 00:36:02.110
Does Master Cheng

00:36:02.110 --> 00:36:03.710
know you took his tea leaves?

00:36:04.360 --> 00:36:05.440
He won't,

00:36:05.440 --> 00:36:06.570
if nobody tells him.

00:36:06.880 --> 00:36:07.970
Now that you've drunk it,

00:36:07.970 --> 00:36:08.590
we are

00:36:08.590 --> 00:36:09.760
on the same boat.

00:36:10.420 --> 00:36:11.550
I'm afraid this boat

00:36:11.630 --> 00:36:13.690
has been infiltrated by the crooked.

00:36:14.230 --> 00:36:15.030
What's worse,

00:36:15.320 --> 00:36:16.800
it's about to capsize.

00:36:18.400 --> 00:36:19.590
Someone ill-intentioned

00:36:19.590 --> 00:36:21.120
has sneaked onto this boat.

00:36:21.280 --> 00:36:22.000
Recently,

00:36:22.000 --> 00:36:23.320
Xifang Tao has done

00:36:23.380 --> 00:36:25.240
much work for the Sword Alliance.

00:36:25.360 --> 00:36:26.190
Externally,

00:36:26.510 --> 00:36:29.150
she publicly offers rewards
for Liu Yan's capture,

00:36:29.150 --> 00:36:30.440
and relentlessly hunts after

00:36:30.440 --> 00:36:31.630
the remaining members of Fengliu Shop.

00:36:31.630 --> 00:36:33.450
Her reputation has quickly soared.

00:36:33.450 --> 00:36:34.630
Now, in people's eyes,

00:36:34.630 --> 00:36:36.510
she's a pioneer in eliminating the evil.

00:36:36.510 --> 00:36:37.400
Internally,

00:36:37.930 --> 00:36:40.440
she cares for those
who were wounded in the battle,

00:36:40.440 --> 00:36:41.880
and patiently offers instructions

00:36:41.880 --> 00:36:44.280
to the new disciples
of the Sword Alliance.

00:36:44.510 --> 00:36:45.800
The last time I met her,

00:36:46.150 --> 00:36:47.070
she was chief

00:36:47.590 --> 00:36:49.520
of the West Palace in Fengliu Shop.

00:36:50.060 --> 00:36:51.460
In just a bit over a month,

00:36:51.630 --> 00:36:53.190
she has somehow become

00:36:53.190 --> 00:36:54.670
a revered heroine of justice.

00:36:54.670 --> 00:36:55.880
It's hard to discern

00:36:55.880 --> 00:36:57.750
the true nature of those of her kind—

00:36:57.750 --> 00:36:59.030
I mean people who are skilled

00:36:59.030 --> 00:37:01.320
in ingratiating themselves with others.

00:37:01.320 --> 00:37:02.920
Master Shao, are you worried

00:37:03.920 --> 00:37:05.920
that she may have ulterior motives?

00:37:09.110 --> 00:37:10.510
As for Mr. Chi...

00:37:10.650 --> 00:37:12.320
why don't I issue a missing person notice

00:37:12.320 --> 00:37:14.180
in the name of the Sword Alliance?

00:37:15.710 --> 00:37:17.670
I'd hate to trouble the alliance now.

00:37:17.670 --> 00:37:19.030
At the moment, our priority

00:37:19.030 --> 00:37:21.560
is to stop the spread
of the Blood Ghost Pills.

00:37:22.030 --> 00:37:23.280
Speaking of which,

00:37:23.400 --> 00:37:24.230
given

00:37:24.350 --> 00:37:26.150
that we've devastated the Sword King City,

00:37:26.150 --> 00:37:26.920
which was the major route

00:37:26.920 --> 00:37:28.670
for selling poison pills
on land and by water,

00:37:28.670 --> 00:37:30.710
and that we've destroyed
Xiuyu Peony Pavilion

00:37:30.710 --> 00:37:31.880
and the Plum Garden,

00:37:32.110 --> 00:37:33.190
there should be less and less

00:37:33.190 --> 00:37:34.710
Blood Ghost Pills.

00:37:35.190 --> 00:37:36.990
Why has there been a large number

00:37:37.030 --> 00:37:38.110
of new victims

00:37:38.110 --> 00:37:39.510
in the past half a month?

00:37:42.320 --> 00:37:43.280
Someone hopes for the disaster

00:37:43.280 --> 00:37:45.480
brought by such Evil Pills to continue.

00:37:45.800 --> 00:37:46.400
It seems

00:37:47.230 --> 00:37:49.070
a new Sword Master of the Sword Alliance

00:37:49.070 --> 00:37:50.480
needs to be elected quickly.

00:37:50.480 --> 00:37:52.010
I was truly in a rush before,

00:37:52.070 --> 00:37:53.400
but now I'm not.

00:37:54.000 --> 00:37:54.630
Why?

00:37:54.800 --> 00:37:55.760
You're already back.

00:37:55.760 --> 00:37:57.090
What's there to worry about?

00:37:57.090 --> 00:37:57.820
Me?

00:38:00.550 --> 00:38:01.010
Come on.

00:38:04.030 --> 00:38:05.400
Now, everyone knows

00:38:05.590 --> 00:38:07.230
Mr. Tang has escaped death

00:38:07.230 --> 00:38:08.520
and regained his martial strength.

00:38:08.520 --> 00:38:09.810
On Mount Cloud,

00:38:10.360 --> 00:38:11.880
in terms of reputation, prestige,

00:38:11.880 --> 00:38:14.480
wisdom, talent, and...

00:38:15.510 --> 00:38:16.710
Let's skip that part.

00:38:17.760 --> 00:38:19.400
I did declare to enter the election,

00:38:19.400 --> 00:38:20.400
but in fact,

00:38:20.760 --> 00:38:22.020
you and I are both aware

00:38:22.230 --> 00:38:23.560
that I'm not suited to be

00:38:24.710 --> 00:38:26.440
the leader of a righteous sect.

00:38:26.590 --> 00:38:27.360
Besides,

00:38:27.780 --> 00:38:29.510
you are completely altruistic,

00:38:29.510 --> 00:38:30.400
while I...

00:38:31.920 --> 00:38:33.180
am totally different.

00:38:33.320 --> 00:38:34.850
You have personal agendas.

00:38:35.170 --> 00:38:37.710
That makes you an even better fit
for the position of Sword Master.

00:38:37.710 --> 00:38:39.440
Otherwise, how are you going to

00:38:40.260 --> 00:38:42.390
abuse public power for personal gain?

00:38:48.920 --> 00:38:50.400
I don't need the Sword Alliance

00:38:50.400 --> 00:38:52.400
to help me with my personal affairs.

00:38:55.620 --> 00:38:56.870
How am I aching again?

00:38:57.150 --> 00:38:58.110
I'd better go meet

00:38:58.110 --> 00:38:58.920
Senior Shui Duopo now

00:38:58.920 --> 00:39:00.980
for another acupuncture treatment.

00:39:01.150 --> 00:39:01.880
Mr. Tang.

00:39:02.190 --> 00:39:03.000
Mr. Tang,

00:39:03.000 --> 00:39:04.000
drink the tea now.

00:39:04.470 --> 00:39:06.800
Put your heart and soul into the election.

00:39:09.070 --> 00:39:09.800
Master Shao.

00:39:19.000 --> 00:39:20.220
What an old weasel.

00:39:27.880 --> 00:39:29.070
These Fengliu Shop disciples'

00:39:29.070 --> 00:39:29.760
bodies

00:39:29.850 --> 00:39:31.260
should be fed to dogs!

00:39:31.670 --> 00:39:33.110
Miss Xifang, how kind of you

00:39:33.110 --> 00:39:34.320
to bury them all.

00:39:34.920 --> 00:39:37.120
Piled-up corpses could cause a plague.

00:39:37.480 --> 00:39:39.410
They must be properly disposed of.

00:39:41.550 --> 00:39:42.080
Hey, you!

00:39:42.360 --> 00:39:43.760
Just dump the body there.

00:39:43.760 --> 00:39:44.890
That's about right.

00:39:47.360 --> 00:39:49.690
Thank you for the hard work,
Master Shangguan.

00:39:49.690 --> 00:39:50.960
I've heard that the poison pills

00:39:50.960 --> 00:39:53.360
have made a particularly fierce comeback.

00:39:54.960 --> 00:39:56.420
God knows what's going on.

00:39:56.440 --> 00:39:57.550
Right after the ferocious battle,

00:39:57.550 --> 00:39:58.280
an enormous number

00:39:58.280 --> 00:40:00.630
of Evil Pills suddenly appeared
in jianghu again.

00:40:00.630 --> 00:40:02.550
Thankfully, the visionary Master Shao

00:40:02.550 --> 00:40:04.360
has ordered a search
for villains at large,

00:40:04.360 --> 00:40:06.000
and those secretly taking Evil Pills
to be detained.

00:40:06.000 --> 00:40:07.480
Also, we're fortunate
to have your instructions

00:40:07.480 --> 00:40:08.320
on the drug crackdown.

00:40:08.320 --> 00:40:09.110
You've taught us how to

00:40:09.110 --> 00:40:10.840
break up Fengliu Shop strongholds

00:40:10.840 --> 00:40:12.360
and deal with those afflicted by poison.

00:40:12.360 --> 00:40:13.020
Otherwise,

00:40:13.190 --> 00:40:14.590
we rough fellows

00:40:14.880 --> 00:40:16.340
would be completely lost.

00:40:18.000 --> 00:40:18.670
Unfortunately,

00:40:18.670 --> 00:40:20.670
some people are still picking on me,

00:40:20.800 --> 00:40:22.860
since I once worked for Fengliu Shop.

00:40:23.070 --> 00:40:24.760
Your contributions to the Sword Alliance

00:40:24.760 --> 00:40:25.660
are evident to all.

00:40:25.660 --> 00:40:26.840
Even commoners are saying

00:40:26.840 --> 00:40:28.030
you're a heroine of justice.

00:40:28.030 --> 00:40:29.400
Just ignore those remarks

00:40:29.400 --> 00:40:30.760
made out of jealousy.

00:40:32.630 --> 00:40:34.400
If I become Sword Master,

00:40:34.900 --> 00:40:36.280
I'll not only eliminate all poison pills

00:40:36.280 --> 00:40:37.340
within half a year,

00:40:38.030 --> 00:40:39.040
but also distribute the gold

00:40:39.040 --> 00:40:40.000
of Fengliu Shop

00:40:40.630 --> 00:40:42.340
to all the elders and disciples

00:40:42.340 --> 00:40:43.420
who fought hard

00:40:43.920 --> 00:40:44.720
in the battle.

00:40:45.520 --> 00:40:46.250
Is that true?

00:40:48.110 --> 00:40:48.800
Of course.

00:40:49.840 --> 00:40:51.230
Mr. Tang brought 100,000 taels of gold in

00:40:51.230 --> 00:40:53.160
when he joined the Sword Alliance.

00:40:53.400 --> 00:40:54.230
I certainly

00:40:54.380 --> 00:40:55.840
need to make a gesture too.

00:40:57.800 --> 00:40:58.280
Hold on.

00:40:59.430 --> 00:41:00.890
Are you trying to bribe me?

00:41:02.280 --> 00:41:05.010
Don't read too much into that,
Master Shangguan.

00:41:05.200 --> 00:41:07.200
Whether I can be Sword Master or not,

00:41:07.790 --> 00:41:10.450
I'll serve the Sword Alliance
wholeheartedly.

00:41:10.840 --> 00:41:11.900
It's getting dark.

00:41:12.070 --> 00:41:13.190
Why don't you bring the disciples back,

00:41:13.190 --> 00:41:14.320
Master Shangguan?

00:41:14.920 --> 00:41:16.850
I'm going to pay a visit to Mr. Tang.

00:41:17.590 --> 00:41:19.320
How nice of you, Miss Xifang.

00:41:19.710 --> 00:41:20.670
Even such exhausting work in the daytime

00:41:20.670 --> 00:41:22.590
can't stop you from visiting Mr. Tang
at night.

00:41:22.590 --> 00:41:24.110
What a devoted member you are.

00:41:24.110 --> 00:41:25.710
I'm only atoning for my sins.

00:41:26.190 --> 00:41:26.710
Okay.

00:41:27.110 --> 00:41:28.800
Brothers, finish up quickly.

00:41:29.190 --> 00:41:30.190
We're going home!

00:41:42.330 --> 00:41:43.710
On my way back from down the mountain
just now,

00:41:43.710 --> 00:41:45.280
I saw these poisoned people

00:41:45.280 --> 00:41:46.440
suddenly assault others.

00:41:46.440 --> 00:41:47.360
I've had those poisoned

00:41:47.360 --> 00:41:48.840
yet living individuals detained.

00:41:48.840 --> 00:41:49.760
These people were from jianghu.

00:41:49.760 --> 00:41:51.400
It was the Evil Pills
that took their lives.

00:41:51.400 --> 00:41:52.920
Some ate too many Evil Pills

00:41:52.920 --> 00:41:54.710
and died when the toxins kicked in.

00:41:54.710 --> 00:41:56.650
Others were attacked and killed
by pill takers.

00:41:56.650 --> 00:41:57.450
When the bodies

00:41:57.450 --> 00:41:58.480
over here were found,

00:41:58.480 --> 00:41:59.660
they were far from each other.

00:41:59.660 --> 00:42:00.400
It proves there has been

00:42:00.400 --> 00:42:02.460
a large-scale outbreak of toxicity.

00:42:03.190 --> 00:42:04.880
Black Tuli has been stolen.

00:42:05.230 --> 00:42:06.190
These wounds were caused

00:42:06.190 --> 00:42:07.480
by the Moon-crossing Ring.

00:42:07.480 --> 00:42:09.480
Did Chi Yun encounter these people?

00:42:10.790 --> 00:42:12.790
Chi Yun has been gone for a long time.

00:42:13.290 --> 00:42:15.150
Even Shen Langhun can't find him.

00:42:15.990 --> 00:42:17.400
Is he in trouble now?

00:42:27.910 --> 00:42:28.510
Oh, right.

00:42:29.190 --> 00:42:29.920
Perhaps

00:42:29.920 --> 00:42:32.980
the Soul-seeking Technique
of Tianren Realm can help.

00:43:00.110 --> 00:43:01.280
Even this technique

00:43:01.280 --> 00:43:02.710
can't locate Chi Yun.

00:43:03.590 --> 00:43:04.760
He must be trapped

00:43:04.760 --> 00:43:05.590
somewhere.

00:43:06.670 --> 00:43:07.510
Mr. Tang,

00:43:07.950 --> 00:43:09.020
can I see you now?

00:43:11.400 --> 00:43:12.440
You've come to me

00:43:13.030 --> 00:43:14.360
before I go to you.

00:43:27.960 --> 00:43:29.360
We finally met again after half a month.

00:43:29.360 --> 00:43:30.760
Mr. Tang, I heard

00:43:30.860 --> 00:43:32.550
that you had not only recovered,

00:43:32.550 --> 00:43:34.280
but also regained
all your martial strength.

00:43:34.280 --> 00:43:36.400
It is great news to the Sword Alliance.

00:43:36.400 --> 00:43:37.960
My survival through great peril

00:43:37.960 --> 00:43:39.630
must be extremely bad news

00:43:40.110 --> 00:43:41.510
to you, Miss Xifang.

00:43:43.110 --> 00:43:45.000
Now, the poison crisis has risen again.

00:43:45.000 --> 00:43:46.110
The Sword Alliance needs

00:43:46.110 --> 00:43:48.480
someone who knows
how to properly deal with it.

00:43:48.480 --> 00:43:49.510
You're indeed

00:43:49.510 --> 00:43:51.510
the best martial fighter in the world.

00:43:51.510 --> 00:43:53.310
But when it comes to this matter,

00:43:53.590 --> 00:43:55.510
you're not as competent as I am.

00:43:56.320 --> 00:43:57.780
How dare you bring this up?

00:43:59.000 --> 00:44:01.130
Although Fengliu Shop has collapsed,

00:44:01.280 --> 00:44:01.880
there is

00:44:02.320 --> 00:44:04.230
a drastic increase in the number of people

00:44:04.230 --> 00:44:05.800
affected by the poison pills.

00:44:05.800 --> 00:44:07.110
I think you know best

00:44:07.110 --> 00:44:08.000
about why,

00:44:08.720 --> 00:44:09.880
don't you?

00:44:10.800 --> 00:44:12.230
You can't prove it.

00:44:12.760 --> 00:44:15.090
Don't throw false accusations, Mr. Tang.

00:44:16.620 --> 00:44:18.680
I've brought you some health tonics.

00:44:18.760 --> 00:44:21.150
Mr. Tang,
if you don't need them for yourself,

00:44:21.150 --> 00:44:22.350
keep them for Mr. Chi,

00:44:22.660 --> 00:44:24.020
who has gone missing.

00:44:24.540 --> 00:44:26.470
Perhaps they'll be helpful to him.

00:44:27.190 --> 00:44:28.850
Mr. Chi has been missing for a long time.

00:44:28.850 --> 00:44:30.250
Had better find him soon.

00:44:31.600 --> 00:44:32.860
No need for the tonics.

00:44:33.110 --> 00:44:35.320
Why did you join the Sword Alliance?

00:44:37.190 --> 00:44:38.480
Did Ghostly Peony send you?